OL,3,GNEWSASantas raise #70k for children's
OL,4,Ahospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Santas have taken to the
OL,7,Fstreets of Chorley to help raise about
OL,8,F#70,000 for a children's hospice.
OL,10,FSome 2,333 people dressed as Father
OL,11,FChristmas to take part in the tenth
OL,12,Fannual Jingle All The Way walk to raise
OL,13,Ffunds for Derian House Children's
OL,14,FHospice in Chorley, Lancashire.
OL,16,FOrganiser Neil Hailwood said he decided
OL,17,Fto start fundraising for the charity in
OL,18,F2012 after they cared for his friend's
OL,19,Fson Ethan, who died aged 11, and the
OL,20,Fevent had grown since the first walk,
OL,21,Fwhich involved 124 people in 2016.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
